codex
I’ve isolated a concrete contract gap: the fallback host behind `event-fast-worker` implements `reset/runUntil/getStats`, but not `stepAsync`. That leaves `event-fast-par` with a no-op step path whenever it falls back. I’m patching that interface only, with persistent step-session state so repeated steps behave correctly.
